# === services/nuwax-workspace 本地产物（入仓 tracked snapshot，但产物忽略） ===
# Phase 1 (2026-07-07):整个 nuwax-workspace 50 个 crate + Cargo.toml/lock
# 都入仓,但 build 产物 / runtime state / 临时 lock 仍不入仓:
# - target/    : cargo build 产物(aarch64 + x86_64 都很大)
# - .omc/      : omc agent runtime state
# - .omx/      : omx runtime state
# - *.lock.tmp : import_nuwax_workspace_snapshot.sh 中途产物
services/nuwax-workspace/target/
services/nuwax-workspace/.omc/
services/nuwax-workspace/.omx/
services/nuwax-workspace/*.lock.tmp
